    "preamble": "Sr.D.Krishnamoorthy vs Food Safety Officer Ii on 31 October, 2014 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated 31.10.2014 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice S.Nagamuthu Crl.OP Sr. No.48991 of 2014 Sr.D.Krishnamoorthy .. Petitioner Vs 1.Food Safety Officer \u0016 Ii, Southern Railway, Chennai Central, Chennai \u0016 600 003. 2.V.Durai Meeran 3.P.Uthrapathy 4.S.Sethuraman .. Respondents",
    "facts": "This petition has been filed by the petitioner seeking to quash the case in S.T.C.No.862 of 2014 pending on the file of the learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Virudhunagar and quash the same which is filed under Sections 52 and 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 2.Registry had doubt about the maintainability of this petition on the ground of territorial jurisdiction. submitted the petition stating that since, the part of the cause of action lies before the jurisdiction of this Court, this petition is maintainable.",
